1
00:00:11,200 --> 00:00:18,260
♪If I am gone from this world,
will the dark night collapse?♪

2
00:00:18,880 --> 00:00:25,820
♪If I never return
to guard by your side♪

3
00:00:26,270 --> 00:00:30,800
♪If I seal away our encounter
and erase all trace♪

4
00:00:31,010 --> 00:00:33,900
♪Like endless snow
falling into the deep sea♪

5
00:00:34,050 --> 00:00:40,350
♪This life is but a fleeting illusion,
yet it gave me courage♪

6
00:00:40,510 --> 00:00:41,740
♪Love is a miracle♪

7
00:00:41,740 --> 00:00:42,920
=Spring Over Phoenix Pond=

8
00:00:42,920 --> 00:00:45,300
(Adapted from Qin An'an's
"Spring Over Phoenix Pond")

9
00:00:45,340 --> 00:00:48,260
=Episode 4=

10
00:00:48,300 --> 00:00:49,790
(Marquis Yongping Residence)

11
00:00:49,790 --> 00:00:50,520
In that case,

12
00:00:51,000 --> 00:00:51,960
investigate this matter clearly

13
00:00:52,150 --> 00:00:53,000
and clear my name.

14
00:00:53,640 --> 00:00:54,470
You wretched servant.

15
00:00:54,470 --> 00:00:55,240
How dare you frame others?

16
00:00:55,320 --> 00:00:55,790
Speak.

17
00:00:56,030 --> 00:00:56,880
Who put you up to this?

18
00:00:57,110 --> 00:00:57,840
If you don't tell the truth,

19
00:00:57,880 --> 00:00:58,560
I'll sell you off!

20
00:01:00,470 --> 00:01:01,520
I didn't.

21
00:01:01,600 --> 00:01:03,470
I really saw the Young Lady
with my own eyes

22
00:01:03,710 --> 00:01:04,590
burying the doll.

23
00:01:04,920 --> 00:01:06,150
His Highness is critically ill now

24
00:01:07,350 --> 00:01:08,590
precisely because she cursed him!

25
00:01:09,950 --> 00:01:11,150
You still won't tell the truth, huh?

26
00:01:16,120 --> 00:01:16,710
- Stop.
- You...

27
00:01:16,950 --> 00:01:17,840
- How dare you disobey!
- You...

28
00:01:18,280 --> 00:01:19,120
Have you lost your mind?

29
00:01:19,480 --> 00:01:20,510
You say I disobeyed?

30
00:01:21,070 --> 00:01:22,120
Come with me and see

31
00:01:22,350 --> 00:01:24,680
who is really framing whom.

32
00:01:24,680 --> 00:01:26,840
How could there be such
a heartless mother in this world?

33
00:01:27,150 --> 00:01:29,200
I was looking for a chance
to get close to her,

34
00:01:29,640 --> 00:01:31,560
and this slap actually helped me out.

35
00:01:35,350 --> 00:01:35,790
Jin,

36
00:01:36,230 --> 00:01:36,920
rest assured.

37
00:01:37,350 --> 00:01:38,710
I will make the butcher's daughter

38
00:01:38,870 --> 00:01:39,640
move out of our house.

39
00:01:41,510 --> 00:01:41,870
Open!

40
00:01:48,200 --> 00:01:49,590
Weren't you dying?

41
00:01:50,480 --> 00:01:52,120
You really colluded with Nanny Zhang

42
00:01:52,120 --> 00:01:53,040
to harm your sister.

43
00:01:54,200 --> 00:01:56,150
Spare me, Marquis.

44
00:01:57,150 --> 00:01:57,950
Sister?

45
00:01:58,560 --> 00:01:59,920
She's not my sister.

46
00:02:01,070 --> 00:02:01,790
Father,

47
00:02:02,230 --> 00:02:03,120
why does she get to come back?

48
00:02:03,400 --> 00:02:04,200
Ever since she returned,

49
00:02:04,200 --> 00:02:05,760
Jin even had to move out
of Mingyue Pavilion.

50
00:02:06,400 --> 00:02:07,950
Jin was wronged so badly.

51
00:02:07,950 --> 00:02:08,680
Absurd!

52
00:02:09,150 --> 00:02:10,240
I did it all for Jin.

53
00:02:10,630 --> 00:02:11,120
Why does she get to take away

54
00:02:11,120 --> 00:02:12,190
everything that belongs to Jin?

55
00:02:13,960 --> 00:02:15,000
I am protecting her.

56
00:02:15,190 --> 00:02:16,000
I just like her.

57
00:02:16,680 --> 00:02:17,560
Shut your mouth.

58
00:02:17,560 --> 00:02:18,190
Shut up.

59
00:02:19,910 --> 00:02:21,080
Get yourself to the study now.

60
00:02:21,240 --> 00:02:22,310
Copy the family rules a hundred times!

61
00:02:23,870 --> 00:02:25,280
Is no one going
to give me an explanation?

62
00:02:28,470 --> 00:02:29,080
And you,

63
00:02:29,120 --> 00:02:29,800
get out.

64
00:02:42,120 --> 00:02:42,630
Mother,

65
00:02:43,240 --> 00:02:44,430
please don't drive me away.

66
00:02:45,080 --> 00:02:46,590
Please don't drive me away.

67
00:02:47,190 --> 00:02:48,030
Jin,

68
00:02:49,000 --> 00:02:50,630
do you think I want to do this?

69
00:02:51,750 --> 00:02:53,800
If Prince Qi hadn't
fallen unconscious recently,

70
00:02:54,680 --> 00:02:56,680
I would have proposed
a marriage for you by now.

71
00:02:58,910 --> 00:03:01,310
But Zhao's marriage
with the Xiang family

72
00:03:01,310 --> 00:03:02,360
cannot be ruined.

73
00:03:04,120 --> 00:03:05,680
You must understand,
I can't disregard the future

74
00:03:05,910 --> 00:03:07,800
of the Qi family just for your sake.

75
00:03:28,400 --> 00:03:29,030
Jin,

76
00:03:29,400 --> 00:03:30,360
don't worry.

77
00:03:31,150 --> 00:03:32,710
I will send people to take care of you

78
00:03:33,560 --> 00:03:35,150
and make sure you want for nothing.

79
00:03:38,030 --> 00:03:39,400
So, Mother,

80
00:03:42,120 --> 00:03:43,680
you don't want me anymore?

81
00:03:53,310 --> 00:03:54,360
Be good.

82
00:03:59,960 --> 00:04:00,800
Why?

83
00:04:01,520 --> 00:04:03,590
It was Qi Zhao
who tampered with the sachet,

84
00:04:03,870 --> 00:04:05,710
and it was also him
who used witchcraft to frame me.

85
00:04:05,710 --> 00:04:06,840
Even if anyone had improper thoughts,

86
00:04:06,840 --> 00:04:08,430
it was him toward me.

87
00:04:09,520 --> 00:04:10,630
How dare you!

88
00:04:11,430 --> 00:04:13,280
Don't you know what matters most

89
00:04:13,280 --> 00:04:14,360
in this household?

90
00:04:23,510 --> 00:04:24,070
Someone come.

91
00:04:24,430 --> 00:04:25,270
Take her away.

92
00:04:25,390 --> 00:04:26,160
- Yes, Madam.
- Yes, Madam.

93
00:04:26,680 --> 00:04:28,680
- (For Zhao's marriage with the Xiangs,)
- Move.

94
00:04:28,830 --> 00:04:30,070
(I can never let you stay.)

95
00:04:30,070 --> 00:04:33,180
(Mingyue Pavilion)

96
00:04:37,120 --> 00:04:37,800
Young Lady,

97
00:04:38,040 --> 00:04:39,040
this is the ointment sent to you

98
00:04:39,040 --> 00:04:40,430
by Prince Jing's men.

99
00:04:43,390 --> 00:04:45,070
This slap actually helped me out.

100
00:04:45,360 --> 00:04:47,390
I was looking
for a chance to get close to her.

101
00:04:47,680 --> 00:04:49,750
Go to our manor and fetch
a jar of Yulong Ointment,

102
00:04:50,040 --> 00:04:51,310
and then give it to the Young Lady.

103
00:04:53,480 --> 00:04:55,800
I heard Miss Jin has been kicked out.

104
00:04:56,190 --> 00:04:56,920
That's wonderful.

105
00:04:57,070 --> 00:04:58,070
From now on, Mingyue Pavilion

106
00:04:58,070 --> 00:04:59,480
belongs to you, Young Lady.

107
00:04:59,480 --> 00:05:00,360
Yuan...

108
00:05:03,830 --> 00:05:06,000
Father, what brings you here?

109
00:05:06,560 --> 00:05:07,800
I came to check on you.

110
00:05:12,870 --> 00:05:14,070
Here is the thing, Yuan.

111
00:05:15,310 --> 00:05:16,750
Now that you've returned home,

112
00:05:17,270 --> 00:05:18,240
I

113
00:05:18,680 --> 00:05:19,600
would like to hold

114
00:05:19,600 --> 00:05:22,120
a grand welcome ceremony for you.

115
00:05:23,190 --> 00:05:25,000
However, regarding this ceremony...

116
00:05:31,390 --> 00:05:32,120
Father,

117
00:05:35,070 --> 00:05:36,680
please feel free to speak directly.

118
00:05:39,390 --> 00:05:41,560
Actually, this is Prince Jing's idea.

119
00:05:42,800 --> 00:05:44,310
Prince Jing learned

120
00:05:44,310 --> 00:05:46,750
that you are close
with the Eldest Princess,

121
00:05:46,870 --> 00:05:48,720
so he wants to use this ceremony

122
00:05:49,270 --> 00:05:51,240
to invite Her Highness down the mountain

123
00:05:51,630 --> 00:05:53,480
to meet with friends and relatives.

124
00:05:54,270 --> 00:05:55,000
Besides,

125
00:05:55,480 --> 00:05:56,870
the Eldest Princess's presence

126
00:05:57,190 --> 00:05:58,600
would bring great honor

127
00:05:58,800 --> 00:06:00,390
to the Qi family as well.

128
00:06:02,630 --> 00:06:03,680
Rest assured, Father.

129
00:06:04,480 --> 00:06:07,480
I will surely invite
the Eldest Princess.

130
00:06:09,240 --> 00:06:09,920
That's wonderful.

131
00:06:10,310 --> 00:06:11,120
Good.

132
00:06:11,160 --> 00:06:12,160
Then, it's settled.

133
00:06:12,560 --> 00:06:13,560
It's settled, then.

134
00:06:14,560 --> 00:06:15,040
By the way,

135
00:06:16,270 --> 00:06:17,070
tomorrow,

136
00:06:17,310 --> 00:06:19,000
the noble ladies of the capital

137
00:06:19,000 --> 00:06:20,630
will go to Guanyin Temple to pray.

138
00:06:20,830 --> 00:06:22,070
You should go along with them

139
00:06:22,240 --> 00:06:24,310
and make an appearance in public.

140
00:06:29,390 --> 00:06:30,800
(Prince Jing,)

141
00:06:31,750 --> 00:06:32,870
(what a clever move.)

142
00:06:50,870 --> 00:06:51,950
Why are you here?

143
00:06:54,160 --> 00:06:55,870
Your Highness sent ointment first,

144
00:06:56,000 --> 00:06:58,070
then forced me to agree
to invite the Eldest Princess.

145
00:06:59,040 --> 00:07:01,070
Didn't you just want me to come see you?

146
00:07:04,120 --> 00:07:05,630
You don't know the Eldest Princess,

147
00:07:06,560 --> 00:07:08,000
yet you used my name

148
00:07:08,040 --> 00:07:09,630
to boost your own status.

149
00:07:10,950 --> 00:07:13,160
That is hardly the conduct
of a virtuous person.

150
00:07:14,480 --> 00:07:15,830
I simply disliked it

151
00:07:16,950 --> 00:07:18,630
and intentionally exposed you.

152
00:07:27,870 --> 00:07:29,510
Your Highness saw today

153
00:07:30,870 --> 00:07:32,630
how the Qi family treats me, too.

154
00:07:34,070 --> 00:07:35,160
What I did

155
00:07:36,070 --> 00:07:37,360
was merely for self-preservation.

156
00:07:39,310 --> 00:07:41,480
The banquet is in just three days.

157
00:07:42,390 --> 00:07:44,310
Marquis Yongping seemed so eager.

158
00:07:44,390 --> 00:07:46,430
He has probably
already sent out the invitations.

159
00:07:46,800 --> 00:07:47,800
The entire capital

160
00:07:47,800 --> 00:07:49,800
is waiting for
the Eldest Princess to arrive.

161
00:07:50,070 --> 00:07:51,040
Young Lady Qi,

162
00:07:52,240 --> 00:07:53,630
how will you clean up this mess?

163
00:07:54,870 --> 00:07:56,600
If I fail to bring her,

164
00:07:57,120 --> 00:08:00,600
I will be thrown out of the house.

165
00:08:01,800 --> 00:08:02,920
Unless

166
00:08:15,560 --> 00:08:16,750
Your Highness helps me.

167
00:08:22,070 --> 00:08:23,510
Your predicament

168
00:08:24,920 --> 00:08:26,120
is indeed pitiful.

169
00:08:28,120 --> 00:08:30,190
But what does that have to do with me?

170
00:08:31,750 --> 00:08:32,630
If I help you,

171
00:08:35,150 --> 00:08:36,910
what benefit is there for me?

172
00:08:57,430 --> 00:09:03,890
♪Leaves fall in the cold wind,
a fleeting glance between pavilions♪

173
00:09:04,970 --> 00:09:11,410
♪Love drifts through the whirlpool
of farewell, brushing past me♪

174
00:09:11,540 --> 00:09:17,200
♪Only longing
leaves me wounded all over♪

175
00:09:17,920 --> 00:09:22,190
♪Yet I still fear you'll forget me♪

176
00:09:22,970 --> 00:09:30,030
♪If I am gone from this world,
will the dark night collapse?♪

177
00:09:30,650 --> 00:09:37,590
♪If I never return
to guard by your side♪

178
00:09:38,040 --> 00:09:42,620
♪This love defies fate,
holding my breath♪

179
00:09:42,780 --> 00:09:45,670
♪To kiss your eyes♪

180
00:09:45,820 --> 00:09:48,500
♪I'd cross seas and lands♪

181
00:09:48,500 --> 00:09:53,100
♪To change an uncertain fate,
never part again♪

182
00:09:53,450 --> 00:09:58,080
♪If I seal away our encounter
and erase all trace♪

183
00:09:58,080 --> 00:10:01,130
♪Like endless snow
falling into the deep sea♪

184
00:10:01,130 --> 00:10:07,500
♪This life is but a fleeting illusion,
yet it gave me courage♪

185
00:10:07,500 --> 00:10:12,380
♪Love is a miracle♪

186
00:10:12,530 --> 00:10:15,080
♪This love defies fate♪

187
00:10:15,180 --> 00:10:19,670
♪To change an uncertain fate,
never part again♪

188
00:10:20,070 --> 00:10:22,610
♪If I seal away our encounter♪

189
00:10:22,780 --> 00:10:26,520
♪Yet it gave me courage♪

190
00:10:26,520 --> 00:10:31,100
♪Love is a miracle♪
